# Check every text file out with LF, on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout converts text to CRLF and the same file has
# different bytes on different machines. That matters here beyond tidiness: the
# release packager compares the UI assets in this repository against the ones
# the launcher was built with, and refuses to ship an archive when they differ.
# Line-ending conversion makes that check fail on Windows for files nobody
# edited.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Assets the launcher loads and licence texts that ship verbatim. Marking them
# binary keeps git from touching their contents at all.
*.png binary
*.bmp binary
*.ttf binary
*.patch -text
